# Third-party deps (intentionally not tracked here).
#   JUCE is documented in BUILD.md as either a submodule or a manual 8.0.12 clone
#   into third_party/JUCE. Rubber Band is documented as vendored / optional submodule.
#   Both are re-fetchable; keeping them out of git keeps the repo small (~110 MB).
third_party/JUCE/
third_party/rubberband/
third_party/.rubberband_broken/

# Logs + FUSE filesystem leftovers.
*.log
**/.fuse_hidden*
